  "releaseNotes": "OpenccNetLib v1.3.1\n\n            This is a maintenance release identical to v1.3.0, focused on developer experience improvements.\n\n            Highlights\n            - 📝 Added XML documentation: the package now includes OpenccNetLib.xml for full IntelliSense support.\n            Hovering over methods like Opencc.Convert() now shows summary, parameter, and return descriptions.\n            - 🔧 Updated project configuration with GenerateDocumentationFile and removed redundant manual XML packing.\n            - 💠 Symbol package (.snupkg) remains available for debugging.\n\n            No functionality or performance changes from v1.3.0.",
